{% set dev = developer.name %}
{% set game = app.name %}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Privacy Policy – {{ game }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for the {{ game }} mobile game by {{ dev }}.">
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
{% include "_style.html.j2" %}
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="meta"><strong>{{ game }}</strong> (Android package <code>{{ app.package }}</code>) by {{ dev }}<br>
Effective date: {{ effective_date_text }}</p>

<p>This Privacy Policy explains how {{ dev }} ("we", "us", "our") collects, uses and shares information when you play
<strong>{{ game }}</strong> (the "Game"). It applies to the Game as distributed on Google Play. By installing or using the
Game you acknowledge this Policy. If you do not agree, please do not use the Game.</p>

<div class="box">
<strong>Summary</strong>
<ul>
{% if collects_anything %}
  <li>The Game{% if sdk_list %} and the third-party services built into it{% endif %} collect{% if not sdk_list %}s{% endif %} limited data: {% for r in data_rows %}{{ r.label | lower }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</li>
{% else %}
  <li>The Game does not collect or share any personal data.</li>
{% endif %}
{% if has_ads %}
  <li>The Game shows ads. Ad partners use device identifiers such as the Advertising ID{% if personalized_ads %} and may personalize ads where you have consented or where the law allows{% else %} to deliver non-personalized (contextual) ads{% endif %}.</li>
{% endif %}
  <li>We do not sell your personal information for money{% if has_ads and personalized_ads %}; sharing for targeted advertising is described under <a href="#us">US state privacy rights</a>{% endif %}.</li>
  <li>You can ask us to delete your data at any time: <a href="data-deletion.html">Data deletion request</a> or <a href="mailto:{{ developer.email }}">{{ developer.email }}</a>.</li>
</ul>
</div>

<nav aria-label="Contents"><ol>
<li><a href="#who">Who we are</a></li>
<li><a href="#collect">Information we collect</a></li>
<li><a href="#use">How we use information</a></li>
<li><a href="#third">Third-party services</a></li>
{% if has_ads %}<li><a href="#ads">Advertising</a></li>{% endif %}
{% if has_iap %}<li><a href="#iap">In-app purchases</a></li>{% endif %}
<li><a href="#legal">Legal bases (EEA/UK)</a></li>
<li><a href="#share">How information is shared</a></li>
<li><a href="#retention">Data retention</a></li>
<li><a href="#rights">Your rights and choices</a></li>
<li><a href="#delete">Deleting your data</a></li>
<li><a href="#us">US state privacy rights</a></li>
<li><a href="#children">Children's privacy</a></li>
<li><a href="#security">Security</a></li>
<li><a href="#transfers">International transfers</a></li>
<li><a href="#changes">Changes to this policy</a></li>
<li><a href="#contact">Contact us</a></li>
</ol></nav>

<h2 id="who">Who we are</h2>
<p>The Game is published by <strong>{{ dev }}</strong>{% if developer.address %}, {{ developer.address }}{% endif %}{% if developer.website %} (<a href="{{ developer.website }}">{{ developer.website }}</a>){% endif %}.
For the purposes of the EU/UK General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR){% if country == "TR" %} and the Turkish Personal Data Protection Law No. 6698 (KVKK){% endif %},
{{ dev }} is the data controller for personal data processed through the Game. Contact: <a href="mailto:{{ developer.email }}">{{ developer.email }}</a>.</p>

<h2 id="collect">Information we collect</h2>
<h3>Information you give us</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Support messages.</strong> If you email us, we receive your email address and whatever you include in the message. We use it only to answer you.</li>
{% if f.accounts %}
  <li><strong>Account information.</strong> If you create or sign in to an account, we process your account identifier{% if "play_games" in sdks %} and the Google Play Games profile name{% endif %} to save your progress and let you sign in on other devices.</li>
{% endif %}
{% if f.user_generated_content %}
  <li><strong>Content you create.</strong> Names, messages or levels you publish in the Game are visible to other players and stored on our servers.</li>
{% endif %}
{% for d in own_data or [] %}
  <li><strong>{{ d.type | replace("_", " ") | capitalize }}.</strong> {{ d.reason }}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% if not f.accounts %}
<p>The Game does not require you to create an account, and we do not ask for your name, email address or phone number in the Game.</p>
{% endif %}

<h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
{% if data_rows %}
<p>When you play, the Game and the third-party services listed under <a href="#third">Third-party services</a> automatically collect the following:</p>
<div class="tbl"><table>
<thead><tr><th>Data</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Collected by</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for r in data_rows %}
<tr><td><strong>{{ r.label }}</strong><br>{{ r.desc }}</td><td>{{ r.purpose_labels | join(", ") }}</td><td>{{ r.sources | join(", ") }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody></table></div>
<p>We do not collect precise GPS location{% if "precise_location" in data_rows | map(attribute="id") | list %} except as described above{% endif %}, contacts, photos, files, or microphone or camera data{% if f.user_generated_content %}, other than content you choose to publish{% endif %}.</p>
{% else %}
<p>The Game does not automatically collect personal data. Game progress and settings are stored only on your device.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="use">How we use information</h2>
<ul>
  <li>To provide and run the Game, save your progress and settings{% if has_iap %}, and deliver items you purchase{% endif %}.</li>
{% if uses_analytics %}
  <li>To understand how the Game is played, measure performance, find and fix bugs and crashes, and improve levels and features (analytics).</li>
{% endif %}
{% if has_ads %}
  <li>To show ads, measure ad performance, cap ad frequency and{% if personalized_ads %}, where permitted,{% endif %} {% if personalized_ads %}personalize ads{% else %}keep ads non-personalized{% endif %}. Ads keep the Game free.</li>
{% endif %}
  <li>To detect fraud, cheating, invalid ad traffic and abuse, and to keep the Game secure.</li>
  <li>To respond to your requests and support messages.</li>
  <li>To comply with legal obligations and enforce our terms.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="third">Third-party services</h2>
{% if sdk_list %}
<p>The Game uses the following third-party services. Each collects information directly from your device under its own privacy policy, which we encourage you to read:</p>
<div class="tbl"><table>
<thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Provider</th><th>Used for</th><th>Privacy policy</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for s in sdk_list %}
<tr><td>{{ s.name }}</td><td>{{ s.company }}</td><td>{{ s.category | replace("mediation", "advertising (mediation)") | replace("crash", "crash reporting") | replace("payments", "in-app purchases") | replace("platform", "sign-in, achievements") | capitalize }}</td><td><a href="{{ s.privacy_url }}" rel="noopener">{{ s.privacy_url }}</a>{% if s.partner_url %}<br><a href="{{ s.partner_url }}" rel="noopener">How Google uses data from partner apps</a>{% endif %}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody></table></div>
{% if ad_sdks | selectattr("category", "equalto", "mediation") | list %}
<p>Our ad mediation platform may request ads from additional ad networks on our behalf. Those networks receive the data
described under <a href="#ads">Advertising</a> and process it under their own privacy policies.</p>
{% endif %}
{% else %}
<p>The Game does not include third-party analytics or advertising services.</p>
{% endif %}

{% if has_ads %}
<h2 id="ads">Advertising</h2>
<p>The Game is free to play and supported by ads served by the partners listed above. To deliver ads, ad partners collect
your device's Advertising ID (or app set ID), IP address (used to estimate your approximate location such as country
and city), device model, operating system, language, and how you interact with ads.</p>
{% if personalized_ads %}
<p><strong>Personalized ads.</strong> Where required by law (for example in the EEA, the UK and Switzerland) we ask for your
consent{% if f.consent_tool %} through a consent message ({{ f.consent_tool }}){% endif %} before ads are personalized. If you
do not consent, you will still see ads, but they will be non-personalized. You can change your choice at any time
{% if f.consent_tool %}from the privacy option in the Game's settings{% else %}by contacting us{% endif %}.</p>
{% else %}
<p><strong>Non-personalized ads.</strong> We configure our ad partners to show only non-personalized (contextual) ads in the Game.</p>
{% endif %}
<p><strong>Opting out.</strong> On Android you can delete or reset your Advertising ID at any time in
<em>Settings &gt; Google &gt; Ads</em> (or <em>Settings &gt; Privacy &gt; Ads</em>). After you delete it, apps can no longer
use it to show you personalized ads.</p>
{% endif %}

{% if has_iap %}
<h2 id="iap">In-app purchases</h2>
<p>Purchases are processed by Google Play. We never receive your card or bank details. Google shares with us the
information needed to deliver your item and confirm the purchase (a purchase token, the item, price and time), which we
keep to restore purchases and for accounting and fraud prevention.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="legal">Legal bases for processing (EEA/UK users)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Performance of a contract</strong> – to provide the Game{% if has_iap %} and the items you buy{% endif %}.</li>
  <li><strong>Legitimate interests</strong> – analytics, crash reporting, security, fraud prevention{% if has_ads and not personalized_ads %}, and showing non-personalized ads{% endif %}. You can object at any time (see <a href="#rights">Your rights and choices</a>).</li>
{% if has_ads and personalized_ads %}
  <li><strong>Consent</strong> – personalized advertising and the related use of device identifiers. You can withdraw consent at any time.</li>
{% endif %}
  <li><strong>Legal obligation</strong> – where the law requires us to keep or disclose data.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="share">How information is shared</h2>
<p>We do not sell your personal information for money. Information is shared only:</p>
<ul>
  <li>with the third-party service providers listed under <a href="#third">Third-party services</a>, for the purposes described there;</li>
{% if has_ads %}
  <li>with advertising partners, so they can show and measure ads;</li>
{% endif %}
  <li>if required by law, court order or to protect the rights, property or safety of {{ dev }}, our players or others;</li>
  <li>in connection with a merger, acquisition or sale of assets, in which case this Policy continues to apply.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="retention">Data retention</h2>
<p>We keep personal data only as long as needed for the purposes in this Policy. Support emails are kept for up to
2 years after the conversation ends. Game progress stored on your device stays there until you uninstall the Game or
clear its data. Data held by third-party services is retained according to their own policies linked above. When data is no longer needed, it is deleted or anonymized.</p>

<h2 id="rights">Your rights and choices</h2>
<p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, delete, or receive a copy of your personal
data, to restrict or object to processing, and to withdraw consent at any time without affecting earlier processing.
To exercise these rights email <a href="mailto:{{ developer.email }}">{{ developer.email }}</a>. We will reply within
30 days. You also have the right to complain to your local data protection authority.</p>
{% if country == "TR" %}
<p><strong>Turkey (KVKK).</strong> Under Article 11 of Law No. 6698 you may learn whether your data is processed, request
information about it, learn the purpose of processing, know the third parties to whom it is transferred in Turkey or
abroad, request correction or deletion, object to results arising from automated analysis, and claim compensation for
damages. Send requests to {{ developer.email }}; you may also apply to the Personal Data Protection Authority (KVKK).</p>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="delete">Deleting your data</h2>
<p>You can request deletion of the data associated with the Game at any time, without uninstalling it, by following the
steps on our <a href="data-deletion.html">data deletion page</a> or by emailing <a href="mailto:{{ developer.email }}">{{ developer.email }}</a>
with the subject "Delete my data – {{ game }}". Uninstalling the Game removes the progress stored on your device.</p>

<h2 id="us">US state privacy rights (including California)</h2>
<p>Residents of California and other US states with privacy laws have the right to know what personal information we
collect, to delete and correct it, and to opt out of the "sale" or "sharing" of personal information for cross-context
behavioral advertising. We do not sell personal information for money.
{% if has_ads and personalized_ads %}Our use of advertising partners for personalized ads may be considered "sharing" under California law.
You can opt out by deleting your Advertising ID (see <a href="#ads">Advertising</a>) or by emailing us; we also honor Global Privacy Control signals where they apply.{% endif %}
We will not discriminate against you for exercising these rights.</p>

<h2 id="children">Children's privacy</h2>
{% if children %}
<p>The Game may be played by children. We comply with the Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA), the GDPR's
rules for children, and Google Play's Families Policy. For users under 13 (or the age of digital consent in their country)
we do not knowingly collect personal information beyond what is permitted to support the internal operations of the Game{% if has_ads %},
we serve only non-personalized ads through Google Play Families self-certified ad SDKs{% endif %}, and we do not
use the Advertising ID for behavioral advertising. Parents can contact us at {{ developer.email }} to review or delete
their child's information.</p>
{% else %}
<p>The Game is not directed to children under 13 (or the minimum age required in your country), and we do not knowingly
collect personal information from them. If you believe a child has provided us personal information, contact us at
{{ developer.email }} and we will delete it.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="security">Security</h2>
<p>We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information. Data sent between the Game and our
service providers is encrypted in transit using HTTPS/TLS. No method of transmission or storage is 100% secure.</p>

<h2 id="transfers">International transfers</h2>
<p>Our service providers may process data in countries other than yours, including the United States. Where required,
such transfers are protected by appropriate safeguards such as the European Commission's Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>

<h2 id="changes">Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Policy from time to time. The new version will be posted on this page with a new effective date.
If the changes are significant, we will notify you in the Game.</p>

<h2 id="contact">Contact us</h2>
<p>{{ dev }}<br>
{% if developer.address %}{{ developer.address }}<br>{% endif %}
Email: <a href="mailto:{{ developer.email }}">{{ developer.email }}</a>{% if developer.website %}<br>Website: <a href="{{ developer.website }}">{{ developer.website }}</a>{% endif %}</p>

<footer>{{ game }} · Privacy Policy · Effective {{ effective_date_text }}{% if app.store_url %} · <a href="{{ app.store_url }}">Google Play</a>{% endif %}</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
